{"id":66659,"date":"2026-09-03T21:06:58","date_gmt":"2026-09-03T20:06:58","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:38","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:38","slug":"10km-coronado","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/10km-coronado\/","title":{"rendered":"10km Coronado 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">10km Coronado 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>10km Coronado 2026<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>25 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>10:00<\/strong> na <strong>Rua da Costa, na Vila do Coronado<\/strong>, concelho da <strong>Trofa<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Esta competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva de cariz solid\u00e1rio mobiliza centenas de atletas e caminheiros numa grande manh\u00e3 de conv\u00edvio e supera\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes participar na veloz <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico com chancela da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto<\/strong> (para nascidos em 2008 e anteriores) ou na <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de ritmo livre e aberta a todas as idades. O percurso percorre art\u00e9rias urbanas e a ciclovia local, assegurando abastecimentos, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha a todos os finalistas e apoio a institui\u00e7\u00f5es de solidariedade da regi\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Coronado Runners<\/strong> e da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal da Trofa<\/strong>, contando com apoio da GNR e entidades desportivas locais para garantir m\u00e1xima seguran\u00e7a e rigor aos atletas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Rua da Costa, Vila do Coronado, Trofa, Porto<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km e 5 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Coronado Runners e C\u00e2mara Municipal da Trofa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/10kcoronado2026.admeus.org\/uploads\/10kcoronado2026\/editor\/10k_coronado_regulamento.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 18 de Outubro:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac + 1 bem alimentar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 12.50 \u20ac + 1 bem alimentar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Ap\u00f3s 18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 18 de Outubro:<\/strong> 7.50 \u20ac + 1 bem alimentar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac + 1 bem alimentar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Ap\u00f3s 18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 10km Coronado 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 10:00 na Rua da Costa (junto ao Trofa bus), na Vila do Coronado, concelho da Trofa, distrito do Porto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui a Corrida de 10 km cronometrada (destinada a atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nascidos em 2008 e anteriores) e a Caminhada de 5 km sem fins competitivos, acess\u00edvel a todas as faixas et\u00e1rias.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e como funciona a vertente solid\u00e1ria?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 18 de outubro de 2026, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o valor de 10,00 \u20ac para a corrida de 10 km e 7,50 \u20ac para a caminhada. De \u00faltima hora, os valores passam para 12,50 \u20ac e 10,00 \u20ac, respetivamente. Cada participante deve doar um bem alimentar no levantamento do dorsal em benef\u00edcio de institui\u00e7\u00f5es sociais locais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais e kits de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os kits e dorsais podem ser levantados no dia 24 de outubro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 12:00 e das 14:00 \u00e0s 21:00 (local a designar), ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, 25 de outubro, das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:30 junto ao Trofa bus (local de partida).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial detalhado e informa\u00e7\u00f5es de percurso podem ser consultados atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de regulamento: https:\/\/10kcoronado2026.admeus.org\/uploads\/10kcoronado2026\/editor\/10k_coronado_regulamento.pdf.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"10km Coronado 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Trofa, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Trofa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o 10km Coronado 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 10:00 na Rua da Costa (junto ao Trofa bus), na Vila do Coronado, concelho da Trofa, distrito do Porto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui a Corrida de 10 km cronometrada (destinada a atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nascidos em 2008 e anteriores) e a Caminhada de 5 km sem fins competitivos, acess\u00edvel a todas as faixas et\u00e1rias.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e como funciona a vertente solid\u00e1ria?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"At\u00e9 18 de outubro de 2026, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o valor de 10,00 \u20ac para a corrida de 10 km e 7,50 \u20ac para a caminhada. De \u00faltima hora, os valores passam para 12,50 \u20ac e 10,00 \u20ac, respetivamente. Cada participante deve doar um bem alimentar no levantamento do dorsal em benef\u00edcio de institui\u00e7\u00f5es sociais locais.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais e kits de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os kits e dorsais podem ser levantados no dia 24 de outubro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 12:00 e das 14:00 \u00e0s 21:00 (local a designar), ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, 25 de outubro, das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:30 junto ao Trofa bus (local de partida).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial detalhado e informa\u00e7\u00f5es de percurso podem ser consultados atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de regulamento: https:\/\/10kcoronado2026.admeus.org\/uploads\/10kcoronado2026\/editor\/10k_coronado_regulamento.pdf.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68639,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66659","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-trofa-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-10km-coronado-766x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"